OL,3,GNEWSAAirport electric fleet to cut
OL,4,Aemissions and noise
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew electric ground service vehicles
OL,7,Fhave been unveiled at London Luton
OL,8,FAirport (LLA) to reduce ground noise
OL,9,Fand cut carbon emissions.
OL,11,FThe fleet will be used for baggage
OL,12,Ftransportation and loading, aircraft
OL,13,Ftowing and moving passengers to
OL,14,Fboarding steps.
OL,16,FHowever, ground operations account for
OL,17,Fless than 1% of the airport's carbon
OL,18,Femissions, producing 4,722 tonnes of
OL,19,Fgreenhouse gases in 2025 compared with
OL,20,F1.3m tonnes from flights, according to
OL,21,FLLA.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
