OL,3,GNEWSAAirport electric fleet to cut
OL,4,Aemissions and noise
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We recognise the hugely important role
OL,7,Fthat airports and the wider aviation
OL,8,Findustry can play in shaping a more
OL,9,Fsustainable future," said LLA chief
OL,10,Fexecutive Alberto Martin.
